    {
      "title": "2 — Installment sale",
      "content": "Leah sells investment land (basis **$200,000**) for **$500,000**. The buyer assumes a **$100,000** mortgage, pays **$80,000** at closing in 2025, and pays **$80,000** a year (plus interest) for 4 years starting in 2026."
    },
    {
      "title": "3 — Equipment for Leah's sole proprietorship",
      "content": "Leah buys and places in service **$4,200,000** of 7-year equipment in 2025, all acquired after January 19, 2025. Business taxable income is ample. She elects the maximum §179 deduction and takes bonus depreciation on the rest."
